{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ModalContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" to render a base screen and an array of modals on top of it."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/init(base:modals:)-8z69p","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/init(base:modals:)-9lnh9"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/base","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/modals"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/Screen-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/Screen-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/SingleScreenContaining-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/workflowmodals\/modalcontainer"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/10WorkflowUI6ScreenP","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/10WorkflowUI22SingleScreenContainingP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14WorkflowModals14ModalContainerV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModalContainer"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ModalContainer","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identi